      "writtenOn": "2023-06-06T02:59:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can\u0027t do that and the comment below explains why. makeDefault() is not called in this case.\n\nThe reason for that is makeDefault() is called by the rematch when the default network changes. However in this case, the rematch doesn\u0027t notice, because the code above removes this network from all requests it serves, which is what the rematch uses as its source data. So makeDefault() is never called.\n\nTried to clarify the comment.",
      "parentUuid": "42e4e48e_68e33209",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4658,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 4658,
        "endChar": 10
      },
      "revId": "dfbedb689d17ae5ab115b5c7206debe2d3ba9876",
